1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,856
How was heaven lost because of one garland?

2
00:00:01,983 --> 00:00:04,947
Sage Durvasa gifted Lord Indra a divine garland.

3
00:00:05,083 --> 00:00:08,014
In his pride, Indra tossed the garland onto his elephant, Airavat.

4
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:11,116
Airavat picked it up with his trunk and threw it on the ground!

5
00:00:11,383 --> 00:00:14,459
Proud Indra! Your Lakshmi will be taken from you!

6
00:00:14,783 --> 00:00:17,032
Indra begged for forgiveness, but the curse had already struck.

7
00:00:17,183 --> 00:00:19,647
At that very moment, Goddess Lakshmi left heaven.

8
00:00:20,117 --> 00:00:22,895
The gods lost their strength, and the asuras took over heaven.

9
00:00:23,283 --> 00:00:23,641
The lesson.

10
00:00:23,771 --> 00:00:26,037
When we become proud, we lose even what we already have.

11
00:00:26,417 --> 00:00:28,556
